    <paragraph>Estimate and Approximate Roots</paragraph>
    <paragraph>In the following exercises, estimate each root between two consecutive whole numbers.</paragraph>
    <exercise number="19" has_solution="true">
      <problem>
        <paragraph>ⓐ $$\sqrt{70}$$ ⓑ $$\sqrt[3]{71}$$</paragraph>
      </problem>
      <solution>
        <paragraph>ⓐ $$8&lt;70&lt;98&lt;70&lt;9$$ ⓑ $$4&lt;713&lt;54&lt;713&lt;5$$</paragraph>
      </solution>
    </exercise>
    <exercise number="20" has_solution="false">
